      "content": "thanks for these. the traditionalist one is exactly what I was looking for. \n\nbut the progressive one feels a bit... i dunno, maybe too extreme? like they sound like they're just trying to burn everything down for no reason. can you rewrite the progressive monologue so they still sound intense and passionate like i asked, but make them sound more like a serious leader with a real plan, rather than just someone being angry?",
